Let’s connect everything.

Cloud Storage
↓
Files (Bronze)
↓
Delta Tables (Silver & Gold)
↓
Unity Catalog (Governance)
↓
DataFrames (Compute API)
↓
Cluster Execution

Storage → Governance → Compute

That is the Lakehouse architecture.

